        "codeSnippet": "/* ❌ BREAKS MOBILE VIEWPORTS: */\ninput { width: 100%; padding: 12px; } /* Total width: 100% + 24px! */\n\n/* ✅ FIXED: */\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }",
